    "Spend less time managing your sales and more time on actually growing your business. Whether you have 1, 2, or 10 branches, Pos allows you to manage them all from one place.": "Hemat waktu mengelola penjualan Anda. POS memungkinkan Anda mengelola seluruh cabang dari satu tempat terpusat.",
    "Buy Now ": "Beli Sekarang ",
    "Manage Your POS.": "Kelola POS Anda.",
    "You can view your sale records through well-maintained data.POS allows you to keep a tab on the total as well as the monthly amounts of sales.": "Anda dapat melihat catatan penjualan Anda secara akurat dengan laporan harian dan bulanan.",
    "Ease in maintaining customer details": "Kemudahan mengelola data pelanggan",
    "POS allows you to create and maintain the data of each customer. You get access to all essential information through a well-maintained format.": "POS memungkinkan Anda membuat dan mengelola data setiap pelanggan dengan mudah.",
    "Stay on top of your total and monthly sales. Get an interactive sales report graph to help you make informed decisions.": "Pantau penjualan total dan bulanan Anda dengan grafik laporan penjualan interaktif.",
    "Take Control Of Your Purchase and Sales": "Kendalikan Pembelian dan Penjualan Anda",
    "Manage all buying and selling activities with one tool. From managing all your products and tracking inventory to managing your branches - POS has everything you need to simplify your organization`s day-to-day tasks.": "Kelola semua aktivitas jual beli dengan satu alat terpadu.",
    "Record Purchases and Sales": "Catat Pembelian dan Penjualan",
    "It is easy to record the purchases and sales of each firm effectively with the help of barcodes. You can also view your purchase and sales records through well-maintained data.": "Mudah mencatat pembelian dan penjualan dengan bantuan pemindai barcode.",
    "Comprehensive Dashboard": "Dasbor Komprehensif",
    "POS allows you to keep a tab on the total as well as the monthly amounts of sales and purchases. The interactive purchase sales report graph allows you to make informed decisions.  You would receive notifications on the dashboard if products reach the minimum quantity.": "POS menampilkan informasi total penjualan dan pembelian serta peringatan stok minimum produk.",
    "Get Instant Notifications": "Dapatkan Notifikasi Instan",
    "Integrate the Twilio app and never miss an important notification again. Get notified when tasks or orders are completed and get notifications about meetings and new orders sent to your mobile phone via text.": "Dapatkan notifikasi instan langsung ke ponsel Anda saat pesanan atau tugas selesai.",
    "Oprate a Fast and Easy Pos process": "Operasikan Kasir dengan Cepat dan Mudah",
    "Make your Pos process fast and convenient for your customers by sending them accurate purchase in record-time. select and add the products your customers want to buy, add notes and assign reference number them, and immediately send email.": "Jadikan proses kasir cepat dan nyaman bagi pelanggan Anda dengan pencatatan dan pengiriman struk instan.",
    "Take Control Of Your Supply Chain": "Kendalikan Rantai Pasokan Anda",
    "You could create your product by assigning brand, category, and unit, and determining tax rate to it. It is easy to create separate listings for each of these modules. This tool allows you to upload product images and descriptions, and fix purchase and selling prices along with Stock Keeping Unit. This tool would solve all your stock mismanagement problems.": "Atur produk, harga beli, harga jual, dan SKU dengan mudah untuk manajemen inventaris yang optimal.",
    "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "Tingkatkan Kinerja Tenaga Kerja Anda",
